__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"VERSAO_TERMOS",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL_TRAD",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return t}});const o="1.0",n={termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Termos de Uso</title></head><body>\n<h1>Termos de Uso \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Vers\xe3o 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Ao criar sua conta, voc\xea concorda com estes Termos, firmados com CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000 (\"IPDRX\").</p>\n<h2>O servi\xe7o</h2><p>O Martelinho Pro ajuda profissionais de martelinho de ouro com or\xe7amentos, agenda, check-in, entregas, caixa e treino. Os valores calculados s\xe3o sugest\xf5es: a decis\xe3o de pre\xe7o e o servi\xe7o prestado ao seu cliente s\xe3o de sua responsabilidade.</p>\n<h2>Sua conta</h2><p>Voc\xea deve ter 18 anos ou mais e informar dados verdadeiros. Cada acesso \xe9 pessoal e vale para 1 celular e 1 computador. A IPDRX pode suspender contas em caso de fraude, compartilhamento de acesso ou uso ilegal.</p>\n<h2>Teste e planos</h2><p>Novos usu\xe1rios podem ter um per\xedodo de teste. A contrata\xe7\xe3o de planos \xe9 feita diretamente com a IPDRX, fora das lojas de aplicativos, com pre\xe7o, dura\xe7\xe3o e renova\xe7\xe3o informados antes do pagamento. Sem plano ativo, o acesso pode ser pausado, sem apagar seus dados.</p>\n<h2>Direito de arrependimento</h2><p>Na contrata\xe7\xe3o \xe0 dist\xe2ncia, voc\xea pode desistir em at\xe9 7 dias corridos da contrata\xe7\xe3o e receber de volta o valor pago, conforme o art. 49 do C\xf3digo de Defesa do Consumidor. Pe\xe7a pelo e-mail <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Cancelamento</h2><p>Voc\xea pode cancelar a qualquer momento, encerrando as pr\xf3ximas cobran\xe7as, pelo mesmo e-mail ou excluindo a conta no app. Assinaturas feitas em uma loja de aplicativos devem ser canceladas nessa loja.</p>\n<h2>Uso permitido</h2><p>\xc9 proibido copiar, revender ou tentar invadir o aplicativo. Fotos e dados que voc\xea inserir devem respeitar a lei e os direitos de terceiros. S\xf3 registre dados dos seus clientes quando tiver base legal para isso.</p>\n<h2>Disponibilidade e responsabilidade</h2><p>Trabalhamos para manter o servi\xe7o dispon\xedvel, mas podem ocorrer interrup\xe7\xf5es. Dentro do permitido em lei, a IPDRX n\xe3o responde por lucros cessantes ou por decis\xf5es tomadas a partir das sugest\xf5es do app. Nada aqui retira direitos garantidos ao consumidor.</p>\n<h2>Licen\xe7as</h2><p>Alguns modelos 3D s\xe3o de terceiros e t\xeam o cr\xe9dito indicado no pr\xf3prio app.</p>\n<h2>Altera\xe7\xf5es e foro</h2><p>Mudan\xe7as importantes ser\xe3o avisadas no app. Aplica-se a lei brasileira, no foro do domic\xedlio do consumidor.</p>\n<p>Consulte tamb\xe9m a Pol\xedtica de Privacidade.</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Pol\xedtica de Privacidade</title></head><body>\n<h1>Pol\xedtica de Privacidade \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Vers\xe3o 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Este aplicativo \xe9 oferecido por CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000 (\"IPDRX\"). Contato para assuntos de dados pessoais: <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Dados que tratamos</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Sua conta:</b> nome, e-mail, WhatsApp e senha (guardada de forma cifrada; nem n\xf3s conseguimos ler).</li>\n<li><b>Seu trabalho no app:</b> oficina, or\xe7amentos, agenda, caixa e os dados dos seus clientes que voc\xea digitar (nome, WhatsApp, placa e carro).</li>\n<li><b>Uso e aparelho:</b> um c\xf3digo do aparelho para o limite de 1 celular e 1 computador, datas de acesso, aberturas do app e visualiza\xe7\xf5es ou cliques em banners.</li>\n<li><b>Pagamentos:</b> plano, valores, datas e situa\xe7\xe3o. Os dados do cart\xe3o ficam com o processador de pagamento, n\xe3o conosco.</li></ul>\n<h2>Fotos</h2><p>A c\xe2mera s\xf3 \xe9 usada quando voc\xea toca para fotografar. As fotos do check-in ficam no seu aparelho e em uma <b>\xe1rea privada da nuvem, que s\xf3 a sua conta acessa</b>, para voc\xea poder busc\xe1-las se precisar. Elas s\xe3o apagadas automaticamente do aparelho e da nuvem 7 dias depois que o carro \xe9 marcado como entregue, prazo para eventual reclama\xe7\xe3o do seu cliente, ou em at\xe9 60 dias se o carro n\xe3o for marcado como entregue. A logomarca que voc\xea escolher para a sua oficina fica guardada na sua conta para aparecer nos or\xe7amentos.</p>\n<h2>Para que usamos</h2><p>Para fazer o app funcionar e guardar seu trabalho (execu\xe7\xe3o do contrato), cobrar e cumprir obriga\xe7\xf5es legais, dar suporte, prevenir fraude e compartilhamento de acesso, e medir o uso. Para patrocinadores informamos apenas n\xfameros totais, nunca quem voc\xea \xe9.</p>\n<h2>Dados dos seus clientes</h2><p>Voc\xea decide quais dados dos seus clientes coloca no app e \xe9 respons\xe1vel por ter base legal para isso. Nesses dados, a IPDRX atua como operadora, seguindo o uso do aplicativo.</p>\n<h2>Com quem compartilhamos</h2><p>S\xf3 com fornecedores necess\xe1rios: Supabase (banco de dados e login, servidores nos Estados Unidos), Expo (atualiza\xe7\xe3o do app), Brevo (e-mails), GitHub (c\xf3pias de seguran\xe7a), Asaas (pagamentos) e servi\xe7o de monitoramento de erros. Como h\xe1 servidores fora do Brasil, ocorre transfer\xeancia internacional de dados, feita para executar o contrato e com fornecedores que adotam medidas de seguran\xe7a. N\xe3o vendemos seus dados.</p>\n<h2>Por quanto tempo</h2><p>Enquanto sua conta existir. Ao excluir a conta, apagamos seus dados pessoais e seu trabalho; eles podem permanecer em c\xf3pias de seguran\xe7a at\xe9 a elimina\xe7\xe3o programada dessas c\xf3pias. Registros de pagamento s\xe3o mantidos sem identifica\xe7\xe3o direta pelo prazo exigido em lei.</p>\n<h2>Seus direitos (LGPD)</h2><p>Voc\xea pode pedir confirma\xe7\xe3o e acesso, corre\xe7\xe3o, portabilidade, elimina\xe7\xe3o e informa\xe7\xf5es sobre compartilhamento, al\xe9m de revogar consentimentos, pelo e-mail acima. Tamb\xe9m pode reclamar \xe0 ANPD.</p>\n<h2>Intelig\xeancia artificial</h2><p>Hoje o app n\xe3o usa intelig\xeancia artificial para tomar decis\xf5es sobre voc\xea. Se isso mudar, avisaremos de forma clara antes de voc\xea usar o recurso.</p>\n<h2>Seguran\xe7a e idade</h2><p>Usamos conex\xe3o criptografada e regras para que cada usu\xe1rio veja somente os pr\xf3prios dados. O app \xe9 destinado a maiores de 18 anos.</p>\n<h2>Excluir a conta</h2><p>No app: Minha loja \u203a Minha conta e privacidade \u203a Excluir minha conta. Ou veja como pedir pela web.</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>Suporte</title></head><body>\n<h1>Suporte \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>Fale com a IPDRX pelo e-mail <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> ou pelo telefone (37) 99999-9921.</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000</p>\n<p>Trocou de celular? Pe\xe7a a libera\xe7\xe3o do novo aparelho. Esqueceu a senha? Na tela de entrada, toque em <b>Esqueci a senha</b>.</p>\n<p>Termos de Uso \xb7 Pol\xedtica de Privacidade \xb7 Excluir conta</p>\n</body></html>\n"},t={en:{termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Terms of Use</title></head><body>\n<h1>Terms of Use \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Version 1.0 \u2014 11/08/2026</p>\n<p>By creating your account, you agree to these Terms, entered into with CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brazil (\"IPDRX\").</p>\n<h2>The service</h2><p>Martelinho Pro helps paintless dent repair professionals with quotes, scheduling, check-in, deliveries, cash records and training. Calculated amounts are suggestions: pricing decisions and the service provided to your customer are your responsibility.</p>\n<h2>Your account</h2><p>You must be 18 or older and provide true information. Each access is personal and valid for 1 phone and 1 computer. IPDRX may suspend accounts in case of fraud, shared access or illegal use.</p>\n<h2>Trial and plans</h2><p>New users may have a trial period. Plans are purchased directly from IPDRX, outside the app stores, with price, duration and renewal disclosed before payment. Without an active plan, access may be paused without deleting your data.</p>\n<h2>Right of withdrawal</h2><p>For distance purchases, you may withdraw within 7 calendar days of purchase and receive a refund of the amount paid, under article 49 of the Brazilian Consumer Protection Code. Request it by email at <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Cancellation</h2><p>You may cancel at any time, ending future charges, using the same email or by deleting your account in the app. Subscriptions made through an app store must be canceled in that store.</p>\n<h2>Permitted use</h2><p>Copying, reselling or attempting to break into the app is prohibited. Photos and data you enter must respect the law and the rights of third parties. Only record your customers' data when you have a legal basis to do so.</p>\n<h2>Availability and liability</h2><p>We work to keep the service available, but interruptions may occur. To the extent permitted by law, IPDRX is not liable for lost profits or for decisions made based on the app's suggestions. Nothing here removes rights guaranteed to consumers.</p>\n<h2>Licenses</h2><p>Some 3D models belong to third parties and are credited in the app itself.</p>\n<h2>Changes and jurisdiction</h2><p>Important changes will be announced in the app. Brazilian law applies, in the courts of the consumer's place of residence.</p>\n<p>See also the Privacy Policy.</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Privacy Policy</title></head><body>\n<h1>Privacy Policy \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Version 1.0 \u2014 11/08/2026</p>\n<p>This app is provided by CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brazil (\"IPDRX\"). Contact for personal data matters: <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Data we process</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Your account:</b> name, email, WhatsApp and password (stored encrypted; not even we can read it).</li>\n<li><b>Your work in the app:</b> shop, quotes, schedule, cash records and the customer data you enter (name, WhatsApp, plate and car).</li>\n<li><b>Usage and device:</b> a device code for the limit of 1 phone and 1 computer, access dates, app opens, and banner views or clicks.</li>\n<li><b>Payments:</b> plan, amounts, dates and status. Card details stay with the payment processor, not with us.</li></ul>\n<h2>Photos</h2><p>The camera is only used when you tap to take a photo. Check-in photos stay on your device and in a <b>private cloud area that only your account can access</b>, so you can retrieve them if needed. They are automatically deleted from the device and the cloud 7 days after the car is marked as delivered, the period for any complaint from your customer, or within 60 days if the car is not marked as delivered. The logo you choose for your shop is kept in your account to appear on quotes.</p>\n<h2>What we use it for</h2><p>To make the app work and keep your work (performance of the contract), to bill and meet legal obligations, to provide support, to prevent fraud and shared access, and to measure usage. We only give sponsors total numbers, never who you are.</p>\n<h2>Your customers' data</h2><p>You decide which of your customers' data to put in the app and are responsible for having a legal basis to do so. For this data, IPDRX acts as a processor, following the use of the app.</p>\n<h2>Who we share it with</h2><p>Only necessary providers: Supabase (database and login, servers in the United States), Expo (app updates), Brevo (emails), GitHub (backups), Asaas (payments) and an error monitoring service. Since there are servers outside Brazil, data is transferred internationally to perform the contract, with providers that adopt security measures. We do not sell your data.</p>\n<h2>How long</h2><p>As long as your account exists. When you delete your account, we erase your personal data and your work; they may remain in backups until those backups are deleted as scheduled. Payment records are kept without direct identification for the period required by law.</p>\n<h2>Your rights (LGPD)</h2><p>You may request confirmation and access, correction, portability, deletion and information about sharing, as well as withdraw consent, using the email above. You may also complain to the ANPD, the Brazilian data protection authority.</p>\n<h2>Artificial intelligence</h2><p>Today the app does not use artificial intelligence to make decisions about you. If this changes, we will clearly notify you before you use the feature.</p>\n<h2>Security and age</h2><p>We use encrypted connections and rules so that each user sees only their own data. The app is intended for people over 18.</p>\n<h2>Delete your account</h2><p>In the app: My shop \u203a My account and privacy \u203a Delete my account. Or see how to request it on the web.</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>Support</title></head><body>\n<h1>Support \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>Contact IPDRX by email at <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> or by phone at +55 (37) 99999-9921.</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brazil</p>\n<p>Changed phones? Request release of the new device. Forgot your password? On the sign-in screen, tap <b>Forgot password</b>.</p>\n<p>Terms of Use \xb7 Privacy Policy \xb7 Delete account</p>\n</body></html>\n"},es:{termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"es-ES\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>T\xe9rminos de Uso</title></head><body>\n<h1>T\xe9rminos de Uso \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Versi\xf3n 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Al crear tu cuenta, aceptas estos T\xe9rminos, celebrados con CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brasil (\"IPDRX\").</p>\n<h2>El servicio</h2><p>Martelinho Pro ayuda a los profesionales de reparaci\xf3n de abolladuras sin pintura con presupuestos, agenda, check-in, entregas, caja y entrenamiento. Los valores calculados son sugerencias: la decisi\xf3n de precio y el servicio prestado a tu cliente son tu responsabilidad.</p>\n<h2>Tu cuenta</h2><p>Debes tener 18 a\xf1os o m\xe1s e informar datos verdaderos. Cada acceso es personal y vale para 1 celular y 1 computadora. IPDRX puede suspender cuentas en caso de fraude, acceso compartido o uso ilegal.</p>\n<h2>Prueba y planes</h2><p>Los usuarios nuevos pueden tener un per\xedodo de prueba. La contrataci\xf3n de planes se hace directamente con IPDRX, fuera de las tiendas de aplicaciones, con precio, duraci\xf3n y renovaci\xf3n informados antes del pago. Sin un plan activo, el acceso puede pausarse, sin borrar tus datos.</p>\n<h2>Derecho de desistimiento</h2><p>En la contrataci\xf3n a distancia, puedes desistir hasta 7 d\xedas corridos despu\xe9s de contratar y recibir de vuelta el valor pagado, conforme al art. 49 del C\xf3digo de Defensa del Consumidor de Brasil. Solic\xedtalo por el correo <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Cancelaci\xf3n</h2><p>Puedes cancelar en cualquier momento, terminando los pr\xf3ximos cobros, por el mismo correo o eliminando la cuenta en la app. Las suscripciones hechas en una tienda de aplicaciones deben cancelarse en esa tienda.</p>\n<h2>Uso permitido</h2><p>Est\xe1 prohibido copiar, revender o intentar invadir la aplicaci\xf3n. Las fotos y los datos que ingreses deben respetar la ley y los derechos de terceros. Registra datos de tus clientes solo cuando tengas base legal para ello.</p>\n<h2>Disponibilidad y responsabilidad</h2><p>Trabajamos para mantener el servicio disponible, pero pueden ocurrir interrupciones. Dentro de lo permitido por la ley, IPDRX no responde por lucro cesante ni por decisiones tomadas a partir de las sugerencias de la app. Nada aqu\xed quita derechos garantizados al consumidor.</p>\n<h2>Licencias</h2><p>Algunos modelos 3D son de terceros y tienen el cr\xe9dito indicado en la propia app.</p>\n<h2>Cambios y jurisdicci\xf3n</h2><p>Los cambios importantes se avisar\xe1n en la app. Se aplica la ley brasile\xf1a, en el fuero del domicilio del consumidor.</p>\n<p>Consulta tambi\xe9n la Pol\xedtica de Privacidad.</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"es-ES\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Pol\xedtica de Privacidad</title></head><body>\n<h1>Pol\xedtica de Privacidad \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Versi\xf3n 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Esta aplicaci\xf3n es ofrecida por CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brasil (\"IPDRX\"). Contacto para asuntos de datos personales: <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Datos que tratamos</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Tu cuenta:</b> nombre, correo, WhatsApp y contrase\xf1a (guardada de forma cifrada; ni nosotros podemos leerla).</li>\n<li><b>Tu trabajo en la app:</b> taller, presupuestos, agenda, caja y los datos de tus clientes que escribas (nombre, WhatsApp, matr\xedcula y auto).</li>\n<li><b>Uso y dispositivo:</b> un c\xf3digo del dispositivo para el l\xedmite de 1 celular y 1 computadora, fechas de acceso, aperturas de la app y visualizaciones o clics en banners.</li>\n<li><b>Pagos:</b> plan, valores, fechas y situaci\xf3n. Los datos de la tarjeta quedan con el procesador de pagos, no con nosotros.</li></ul>\n<h2>Fotos</h2><p>La c\xe1mara solo se usa cuando tocas para fotografiar. Las fotos del check-in quedan en tu dispositivo y en un <b>\xe1rea privada de la nube a la que solo tu cuenta accede</b>, para que puedas buscarlas si lo necesitas. Se borran autom\xe1ticamente del dispositivo y de la nube 7 d\xedas despu\xe9s de que el auto se marque como entregado, plazo para un eventual reclamo de tu cliente, o en hasta 60 d\xedas si el auto no se marca como entregado. El logotipo que elijas para tu taller queda guardado en tu cuenta para aparecer en los presupuestos.</p>\n<h2>Para qu\xe9 los usamos</h2><p>Para hacer funcionar la app y guardar tu trabajo (ejecuci\xf3n del contrato), cobrar y cumplir obligaciones legales, dar soporte, prevenir fraude y acceso compartido, y medir el uso. A los patrocinadores solo les informamos n\xfameros totales, nunca qui\xe9n eres.</p>\n<h2>Datos de tus clientes</h2><p>T\xfa decides qu\xe9 datos de tus clientes pones en la app y eres responsable de tener base legal para ello. En esos datos, IPDRX act\xfaa como encargada del tratamiento, siguiendo el uso de la aplicaci\xf3n.</p>\n<h2>Con qui\xe9n compartimos</h2><p>Solo con proveedores necesarios: Supabase (base de datos e inicio de sesi\xf3n, servidores en Estados Unidos), Expo (actualizaci\xf3n de la app), Brevo (correos), GitHub (copias de seguridad), Asaas (pagos) y un servicio de monitoreo de errores. Como hay servidores fuera de Brasil, ocurre transferencia internacional de datos, hecha para ejecutar el contrato y con proveedores que adoptan medidas de seguridad. No vendemos tus datos.</p>\n<h2>Por cu\xe1nto tiempo</h2><p>Mientras exista tu cuenta. Al eliminar la cuenta, borramos tus datos personales y tu trabajo; pueden permanecer en copias de seguridad hasta la eliminaci\xf3n programada de esas copias. Los registros de pago se mantienen sin identificaci\xf3n directa durante el plazo exigido por ley.</p>\n<h2>Tus derechos (LGPD)</h2><p>Puedes pedir confirmaci\xf3n y acceso, correcci\xf3n, portabilidad, eliminaci\xf3n e informaci\xf3n sobre el intercambio de datos, adem\xe1s de revocar consentimientos, por el correo indicado arriba. Tambi\xe9n puedes reclamar ante la ANPD, la autoridad brasile\xf1a de protecci\xf3n de datos.</p>\n<h2>Inteligencia artificial</h2><p>Hoy la app no usa inteligencia artificial para tomar decisiones sobre ti. Si esto cambia, avisaremos de forma clara antes de que uses el recurso.</p>\n<h2>Seguridad y edad</h2><p>Usamos conexi\xf3n cifrada y reglas para que cada usuario vea solo sus propios datos. La app est\xe1 destinada a mayores de 18 a\xf1os.</p>\n<h2>Eliminar la cuenta</h2><p>En la app: Mi taller \u203a Mi cuenta y privacidad \u203a Eliminar mi cuenta. O mira c\xf3mo solicitarlo por la web.</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"es-ES\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>Soporte</title></head><body>\n<h1>Soporte \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>Habla con IPDRX por el correo <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> o por el tel\xe9fono +55 (37) 99999-9921.</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brasil</p>\n<p>\xbfCambiaste de celular? Pide la liberaci\xf3n del nuevo dispositivo. \xbfOlvidaste la contrase\xf1a? En la pantalla de entrada, toca <b>Olvid\xe9 la contrase\xf1a</b>.</p>\n<p>T\xe9rminos de Uso \xb7 Pol\xedtica de Privacidad \xb7 Eliminar cuenta</p>\n</body></html>\n"},fr:{termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"fr-FR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Conditions d'utilisation</title></head><body>\n<h1>Conditions d'utilisation \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Version 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>En cr\xe9ant votre compte, vous acceptez les pr\xe9sentes Conditions, conclues avec CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Br\xe9sil (\xab IPDRX \xbb).</p>\n<h2>Le service</h2><p>Martelinho Pro aide les professionnels du d\xe9bosselage sans peinture pour les devis, l'agenda, le check-in, les livraisons, la caisse et l'entra\xeenement. Les montants calcul\xe9s sont des suggestions : la d\xe9cision de prix et le service rendu \xe0 votre client rel\xe8vent de votre responsabilit\xe9.</p>\n<h2>Votre compte</h2><p>Vous devez avoir 18 ans ou plus et fournir des informations exactes. Chaque acc\xe8s est personnel et valable pour 1 t\xe9l\xe9phone et 1 ordinateur. IPDRX peut suspendre des comptes en cas de fraude, de partage d'acc\xe8s ou d'utilisation ill\xe9gale.</p>\n<h2>Essai et forfaits</h2><p>Les nouveaux utilisateurs peuvent b\xe9n\xe9ficier d'une p\xe9riode d'essai. La souscription aux forfaits se fait directement aupr\xe8s d'IPDRX, en dehors des boutiques d'applications, avec le prix, la dur\xe9e et le renouvellement indiqu\xe9s avant le paiement. Sans forfait actif, l'acc\xe8s peut \xeatre suspendu, sans supprimer vos donn\xe9es.</p>\n<h2>Droit de r\xe9tractation</h2><p>Pour une souscription \xe0 distance, vous pouvez vous r\xe9tracter dans les 7 jours calendaires suivant la souscription et \xeatre rembours\xe9 du montant pay\xe9, conform\xe9ment \xe0 l'art. 49 du Code br\xe9silien de d\xe9fense du consommateur. Faites la demande par e-mail \xe0 <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>R\xe9siliation</h2><p>Vous pouvez r\xe9silier \xe0 tout moment, mettant fin aux prochains pr\xe9l\xe8vements, via le m\xeame e-mail ou en supprimant le compte dans l'app. Les abonnements souscrits dans une boutique d'applications doivent \xeatre r\xe9sili\xe9s dans cette boutique.</p>\n<h2>Utilisation autoris\xe9e</h2><p>Il est interdit de copier, revendre ou tenter de pirater l'application. Les photos et donn\xe9es que vous saisissez doivent respecter la loi et les droits des tiers. N'enregistrez les donn\xe9es de vos clients que si vous disposez d'une base l\xe9gale pour le faire.</p>\n<h2>Disponibilit\xe9 et responsabilit\xe9</h2><p>Nous travaillons \xe0 maintenir le service disponible, mais des interruptions peuvent survenir. Dans les limites permises par la loi, IPDRX n'est pas responsable des pertes de profits ni des d\xe9cisions prises sur la base des suggestions de l'app. Rien ici ne retire les droits garantis au consommateur.</p>\n<h2>Licences</h2><p>Certains mod\xe8les 3D appartiennent \xe0 des tiers et leur cr\xe9dit est indiqu\xe9 dans l'app.</p>\n<h2>Modifications et juridiction</h2><p>Les modifications importantes seront annonc\xe9es dans l'app. La loi br\xe9silienne s'applique, devant le tribunal du domicile du consommateur.</p>\n<p>Consultez \xe9galement la Politique de confidentialit\xe9.</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"fr-FR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Politique de confidentialit\xe9</title></head><body>\n<h1>Politique de confidentialit\xe9 \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Version 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Cette application est propos\xe9e par CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Br\xe9sil (\xab IPDRX \xbb). Contact pour les questions de donn\xe9es personnelles : <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Donn\xe9es trait\xe9es</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Votre compte :</b> nom, e-mail, WhatsApp et mot de passe (stock\xe9 de fa\xe7on chiffr\xe9e ; m\xeame nous ne pouvons pas le lire).</li>\n<li><b>Votre travail dans l'app :</b> atelier, devis, agenda, caisse et donn\xe9es de vos clients que vous saisissez (nom, WhatsApp, plaque et voiture).</li>\n<li><b>Utilisation et appareil :</b> un code d'appareil pour la limite de 1 t\xe9l\xe9phone et 1 ordinateur, dates d'acc\xe8s, ouvertures de l'app et vues ou clics sur les banni\xe8res.</li>\n<li><b>Paiements :</b> forfait, montants, dates et statut. Les donn\xe9es de carte restent chez le prestataire de paiement, pas chez nous.</li></ul>\n<h2>Photos</h2><p>L'appareil photo n'est utilis\xe9 que lorsque vous touchez pour photographier. Les photos du check-in restent sur votre appareil et dans une <b>zone priv\xe9e du cloud accessible uniquement par votre compte</b>, afin que vous puissiez les r\xe9cup\xe9rer si besoin. Elles sont supprim\xe9es automatiquement de l'appareil et du cloud 7 jours apr\xe8s que la voiture a \xe9t\xe9 marqu\xe9e comme livr\xe9e, d\xe9lai pour une \xe9ventuelle r\xe9clamation de votre client, ou dans un d\xe9lai de 60 jours si la voiture n'est pas marqu\xe9e comme livr\xe9e. Le logo choisi pour votre atelier reste enregistr\xe9 dans votre compte pour figurer sur les devis.</p>\n<h2>Finalit\xe9s</h2><p>Pour faire fonctionner l'app et conserver votre travail (ex\xe9cution du contrat), facturer et respecter les obligations l\xe9gales, assurer l'assistance, pr\xe9venir la fraude et le partage d'acc\xe8s, et mesurer l'utilisation. Aux sponsors, nous ne communiquons que des chiffres globaux, jamais votre identit\xe9.</p>\n<h2>Donn\xe9es de vos clients</h2><p>Vous d\xe9cidez quelles donn\xe9es de vos clients vous saisissez dans l'app et \xeates responsable de disposer d'une base l\xe9gale pour cela. Pour ces donn\xe9es, IPDRX agit en tant que sous-traitant, selon l'utilisation de l'application.</p>\n<h2>Avec qui nous partageons</h2><p>Uniquement avec les prestataires n\xe9cessaires : Supabase (base de donn\xe9es et connexion, serveurs aux \xc9tats-Unis), Expo (mise \xe0 jour de l'app), Brevo (e-mails), GitHub (sauvegardes), Asaas (paiements) et un service de suivi des erreurs. Comme il existe des serveurs hors du Br\xe9sil, un transfert international de donn\xe9es a lieu, pour ex\xe9cuter le contrat et avec des prestataires qui adoptent des mesures de s\xe9curit\xe9. Nous ne vendons pas vos donn\xe9es.</p>\n<h2>Dur\xe9e de conservation</h2><p>Tant que votre compte existe. \xc0 la suppression du compte, nous effa\xe7ons vos donn\xe9es personnelles et votre travail ; ils peuvent subsister dans des sauvegardes jusqu'\xe0 leur suppression programm\xe9e. Les enregistrements de paiement sont conserv\xe9s sans identification directe pendant la dur\xe9e exig\xe9e par la loi.</p>\n<h2>Vos droits (LGPD)</h2><p>Vous pouvez demander la confirmation et l'acc\xe8s, la correction, la portabilit\xe9, l'effacement et des informations sur le partage, ainsi que retirer vos consentements, via l'e-mail ci-dessus. Vous pouvez aussi saisir l'ANPD, l'autorit\xe9 br\xe9silienne de protection des donn\xe9es.</p>\n<h2>Intelligence artificielle</h2><p>Aujourd'hui, l'app n'utilise pas l'intelligence artificielle pour prendre des d\xe9cisions vous concernant. Si cela change, nous vous en informerons clairement avant que vous n'utilisiez la fonctionnalit\xe9.</p>\n<h2>S\xe9curit\xe9 et \xe2ge</h2><p>Nous utilisons une connexion chiffr\xe9e et des r\xe8gles pour que chaque utilisateur ne voie que ses propres donn\xe9es. L'app est destin\xe9e aux personnes majeures de plus de 18 ans.</p>\n<h2>Supprimer le compte</h2><p>Dans l'app : Mon atelier \u203a Mon compte et confidentialit\xe9 \u203a Supprimer mon compte. Ou voyez comment en faire la demande sur le web.</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"fr-FR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>Assistance</title></head><body>\n<h1>Assistance \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>Contactez IPDRX par e-mail \xe0 <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> ou par t\xe9l\xe9phone au +55 (37) 99999-9921.</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Br\xe9sil</p>\n<p>Vous avez chang\xe9 de t\xe9l\xe9phone ? Demandez le d\xe9blocage du nouvel appareil. Mot de passe oubli\xe9 ? Sur l'\xe9cran de connexion, touchez <b>Mot de passe oubli\xe9</b>.</p>\n<p>Conditions d'utilisation \xb7 Politique de confidentialit\xe9 \xb7 Supprimer le compte</p>\n</body></html>\n"},it:{termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"it-IT\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Termini d'uso</title></head><body>\n<h1>Termini d'uso \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Versione 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Creando il tuo account, accetti questi Termini, stipulati con CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brasile (\"IPDRX\").</p>\n<h2>Il servizio</h2><p>Martelinho Pro aiuta i professionisti della riparazione di ammaccature senza verniciatura con preventivi, agenda, check-in, consegne, cassa e allenamento. I valori calcolati sono suggerimenti: la decisione sul prezzo e il servizio reso al tuo cliente sono sotto la tua responsabilit\xe0.</p>\n<h2>Il tuo account</h2><p>Devi avere almeno 18 anni e fornire dati veritieri. Ogni accesso \xe8 personale e vale per 1 telefono e 1 computer. IPDRX pu\xf2 sospendere gli account in caso di frode, condivisione dell'accesso o uso illegale.</p>\n<h2>Prova e piani</h2><p>I nuovi utenti possono avere un periodo di prova. I piani si acquistano direttamente da IPDRX, fuori dagli store di applicazioni, con prezzo, durata e rinnovo indicati prima del pagamento. Senza un piano attivo, l'accesso pu\xf2 essere sospeso, senza cancellare i tuoi dati.</p>\n<h2>Diritto di recesso</h2><p>Per l'acquisto a distanza, puoi recedere entro 7 giorni di calendario dall'acquisto e ricevere il rimborso dell'importo pagato, ai sensi dell'art. 49 del Codice brasiliano di difesa del consumatore. Richiedilo via e-mail a <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Annullamento</h2><p>Puoi annullare in qualsiasi momento, interrompendo i prossimi addebiti, tramite la stessa e-mail o eliminando l'account nell'app. Gli abbonamenti effettuati in uno store di applicazioni devono essere annullati in quello store.</p>\n<h2>Uso consentito</h2><p>\xc8 vietato copiare, rivendere o tentare di violare l'applicazione. Le foto e i dati che inserisci devono rispettare la legge e i diritti di terzi. Registra i dati dei tuoi clienti solo quando hai una base giuridica per farlo.</p>\n<h2>Disponibilit\xe0 e responsabilit\xe0</h2><p>Lavoriamo per mantenere il servizio disponibile, ma possono verificarsi interruzioni. Nei limiti consentiti dalla legge, IPDRX non risponde del mancato guadagno n\xe9 delle decisioni prese in base ai suggerimenti dell'app. Nulla qui toglie i diritti garantiti al consumatore.</p>\n<h2>Licenze</h2><p>Alcuni modelli 3D appartengono a terzi e hanno il credito indicato nell'app.</p>\n<h2>Modifiche e foro</h2><p>Le modifiche importanti saranno comunicate nell'app. Si applica la legge brasiliana, nel foro del domicilio del consumatore.</p>\n<p>Consulta anche l'Informativa sulla privacy.</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"it-IT\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Informativa sulla privacy</title></head><body>\n<h1>Informativa sulla privacy \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">Versione 1.0 \u2014 08/11/2026</p>\n<p>Questa applicazione \xe8 offerta da CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brasile (\"IPDRX\"). Contatto per questioni relative ai dati personali: <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>Dati che trattiamo</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Il tuo account:</b> nome, e-mail, WhatsApp e password (salvata in forma cifrata; nemmeno noi possiamo leggerla).</li>\n<li><b>Il tuo lavoro nell'app:</b> officina, preventivi, agenda, cassa e i dati dei tuoi clienti che inserisci (nome, WhatsApp, targa e auto).</li>\n<li><b>Uso e dispositivo:</b> un codice del dispositivo per il limite di 1 telefono e 1 computer, date di accesso, aperture dell'app e visualizzazioni o clic sui banner.</li>\n<li><b>Pagamenti:</b> piano, importi, date e stato. I dati della carta restano presso il processore di pagamento, non presso di noi.</li></ul>\n<h2>Foto</h2><p>La fotocamera viene usata solo quando tocchi per scattare. Le foto del check-in restano sul tuo dispositivo e in un'<b>area privata del cloud accessibile solo dal tuo account</b>, cos\xec puoi recuperarle se serve. Vengono cancellate automaticamente dal dispositivo e dal cloud 7 giorni dopo che l'auto \xe8 segnata come consegnata, termine per un eventuale reclamo del tuo cliente, o entro 60 giorni se l'auto non viene segnata come consegnata. Il logo scelto per la tua officina resta salvato nel tuo account per apparire nei preventivi.</p>\n<h2>Per cosa li usiamo</h2><p>Per far funzionare l'app e conservare il tuo lavoro (esecuzione del contratto), addebitare e adempiere agli obblighi di legge, fornire assistenza, prevenire frodi e condivisione dell'accesso e misurare l'uso. Agli sponsor comunichiamo solo numeri totali, mai chi sei.</p>\n<h2>Dati dei tuoi clienti</h2><p>Decidi tu quali dati dei tuoi clienti inserire nell'app e sei responsabile di avere una base giuridica per farlo. Per questi dati, IPDRX agisce come responsabile del trattamento, secondo l'uso dell'applicazione.</p>\n<h2>Con chi condividiamo</h2><p>Solo con i fornitori necessari: Supabase (database e accesso, server negli Stati Uniti), Expo (aggiornamento dell'app), Brevo (e-mail), GitHub (copie di sicurezza), Asaas (pagamenti) e un servizio di monitoraggio degli errori. Poich\xe9 ci sono server fuori dal Brasile, avviene un trasferimento internazionale di dati, effettuato per eseguire il contratto e con fornitori che adottano misure di sicurezza. Non vendiamo i tuoi dati.</p>\n<h2>Per quanto tempo</h2><p>Finch\xe9 esiste il tuo account. Eliminando l'account, cancelliamo i tuoi dati personali e il tuo lavoro; possono restare nelle copie di sicurezza fino alla loro eliminazione programmata. I registri di pagamento sono conservati senza identificazione diretta per il periodo richiesto dalla legge.</p>\n<h2>I tuoi diritti (LGPD)</h2><p>Puoi chiedere conferma e accesso, rettifica, portabilit\xe0, cancellazione e informazioni sulla condivisione, oltre a revocare i consensi, tramite l'e-mail indicata sopra. Puoi anche presentare reclamo all'ANPD, l'autorit\xe0 brasiliana per la protezione dei dati.</p>\n<h2>Intelligenza artificiale</h2><p>Oggi l'app non usa l'intelligenza artificiale per prendere decisioni su di te. Se questo cambier\xe0, ti avviseremo chiaramente prima che tu usi la funzione.</p>\n<h2>Sicurezza ed et\xe0</h2><p>Usiamo una connessione cifrata e regole affinch\xe9 ogni utente veda solo i propri dati. L'app \xe8 destinata ai maggiori di 18 anni.</p>\n<h2>Eliminare l'account</h2><p>Nell'app: La mia officina \u203a Il mio account e privacy \u203a Elimina il mio account. Oppure vedi come richiederlo sul web.</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"it-IT\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>Assistenza</title></head><body>\n<h1>Assistenza \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>Contatta IPDRX via e-mail a <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> o al telefono +55 (37) 99999-9921.</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brasile</p>\n<p>Hai cambiato telefono? Chiedi lo sblocco del nuovo dispositivo. Password dimenticata? Nella schermata di accesso, tocca <b>Password dimenticata</b>.</p>\n<p>Termini d'uso \xb7 Informativa sulla privacy \xb7 Elimina account</p>\n</body></html>\n"},tr:{termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"tr-TR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015fullar\u0131</title></head><body>\n<h1>Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015fullar\u0131 \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">S\xfcr\xfcm 1.0 \u2014 08.11.2026</p>\n<p>Hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 olu\u015fturarak, CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brezilya (\"IPDRX\") ile yap\u0131lan bu Ko\u015fullar\u0131 kabul edersiniz.</p>\n<h2>Hizmet</h2><p>Martelinho Pro, boyas\u0131z g\xf6\xe7\xfck onar\u0131m\u0131 profesyonellerine teklif, ajanda, check-in, teslimat, kasa ve e\u011fitim konular\u0131nda yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur. Hesaplanan tutarlar \xf6neridir: fiyat karar\u0131 ve m\xfc\u015fterinize verilen hizmet sizin sorumlulu\u011funuzdad\u0131r.</p>\n<h2>Hesab\u0131n\u0131z</h2><p>18 ya\u015f\u0131nda veya daha b\xfcy\xfck olmal\u0131 ve do\u011fru bilgi vermelisiniz. Her eri\u015fim ki\u015fiseldir ve 1 telefon ile 1 bilgisayar i\xe7in ge\xe7erlidir. IPDRX; doland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131l\u0131k, eri\u015fim payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 veya yasa d\u0131\u015f\u0131 kullan\u0131m durumunda hesaplar\u0131 ask\u0131ya alabilir.</p>\n<h2>Deneme ve planlar</h2><p>Yeni kullan\u0131c\u0131lara deneme s\xfcresi tan\u0131nabilir. Planlar, uygulama ma\u011fazalar\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda do\u011frudan IPDRX'ten al\u0131n\u0131r; fiyat, s\xfcre ve yenileme \xf6deme \xf6ncesinde bildirilir. Etkin plan olmadan eri\u015fim, verileriniz silinmeden duraklat\u0131labilir.</p>\n<h2>Cayma hakk\u0131</h2><p>Mesafeli al\u0131mlarda, Brezilya T\xfcketiciyi Koruma Kanunu'nun 49. maddesi uyar\u0131nca, al\u0131mdan itibaren 7 takvim g\xfcn\xfc i\xe7inde vazge\xe7ip \xf6dedi\u011finiz tutar\u0131 geri alabilirsiniz. Talebinizi <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> adresine iletin.</p>\n<h2>\u0130ptal</h2><p>Ayn\u0131 e-posta ile veya uygulamada hesab\u0131 silerek istedi\u011finiz zaman iptal edebilir, sonraki \xf6demeleri durdurabilirsiniz. Bir uygulama ma\u011fazas\u0131ndan yap\u0131lan abonelikler o ma\u011fazadan iptal edilmelidir.</p>\n<h2>\u0130zin verilen kullan\u0131m</h2><p>Uygulamay\u0131 kopyalamak, yeniden satmak veya izinsiz eri\u015fmeye \xe7al\u0131\u015fmak yasakt\u0131r. Girdi\u011finiz foto\u011fraflar ve veriler yasalara ve \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc ki\u015filerin haklar\u0131na uygun olmal\u0131d\u0131r. M\xfc\u015fterilerinizin verilerini yaln\u0131zca yasal dayana\u011f\u0131n\u0131z varsa kaydedin.</p>\n<h2>Eri\u015filebilirlik ve sorumluluk</h2><p>Hizmeti eri\u015filebilir tutmak i\xe7in \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yoruz, ancak kesintiler olabilir. Yasalar\u0131n izin verdi\u011fi \xf6l\xe7\xfcde IPDRX, k\xe2r kayb\u0131ndan veya uygulama \xf6nerilerine dayan\u0131larak al\u0131nan kararlardan sorumlu de\u011fildir. Buradaki hi\xe7bir h\xfck\xfcm t\xfcketiciye tan\u0131nan haklar\u0131 ortadan kald\u0131rmaz.</p>\n<h2>Lisanslar</h2><p>Baz\u0131 3D modeller \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc ki\u015filere aittir ve kaynaklar\u0131 uygulamada belirtilmi\u015ftir.</p>\n<h2>De\u011fi\u015fiklikler ve yetkili mahkeme</h2><p>\xd6nemli de\u011fi\u015fiklikler uygulamada duyurulur. Brezilya hukuku uygulan\u0131r; yetkili mahkeme t\xfcketicinin ikametg\xe2h\u0131ndaki mahkemedir.</p>\n<p>Ayr\u0131ca Gizlilik Politikas\u0131 sayfas\u0131na bak\u0131n.</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"tr-TR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>Gizlilik Politikas\u0131</title></head><body>\n<h1>Gizlilik Politikas\u0131 \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">S\xfcr\xfcm 1.0 \u2014 08.11.2026</p>\n<p>Bu uygulama CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA, CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85, Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brezilya (\"IPDRX\") taraf\u0131ndan sunulur. Ki\u015fisel veri konular\u0131nda ileti\u015fim: <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>\u0130\u015fledi\u011fimiz veriler</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Hesab\u0131n\u0131z:</b> ad, e-posta, WhatsApp ve \u015fifre (\u015fifreli saklan\u0131r; biz bile okuyamay\u0131z).</li>\n<li><b>Uygulamadaki i\u015finiz:</b> d\xfckk\xe2n, teklifler, ajanda, kasa ve girdi\u011finiz m\xfc\u015fteri verileri (ad, WhatsApp, plaka ve ara\xe7).</li>\n<li><b>Kullan\u0131m ve cihaz:</b> 1 telefon ve 1 bilgisayar s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 i\xe7in cihaz kodu, eri\u015fim tarihleri, uygulama a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015flar\u0131 ve banner g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleme veya t\u0131klamalar\u0131.</li>\n<li><b>\xd6demeler:</b> plan, tutarlar, tarihler ve durum. Kart bilgileri bizde de\u011fil, \xf6deme kurulu\u015funda kal\u0131r.</li></ul>\n<h2>Foto\u011fraflar</h2><p>Kamera yaln\u0131zca foto\u011fraf \xe7ekmek i\xe7in dokundu\u011funuzda kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Check-in foto\u011fraflar\u0131 cihaz\u0131n\u0131zda ve gerekti\u011finde alabilmeniz i\xe7in <b>yaln\u0131zca hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n eri\u015febildi\u011fi \xf6zel bir bulut alan\u0131nda</b> kal\u0131r. M\xfc\u015fterinizin olas\u0131 \u015fik\xe2yeti i\xe7in tan\u0131nan s\xfcre olarak, ara\xe7 teslim edildi olarak i\u015faretlendikten 7 g\xfcn sonra veya i\u015faretlenmezse en ge\xe7 60 g\xfcn i\xe7inde cihazdan ve buluttan otomatik silinir. D\xfckk\xe2n\u0131n\u0131z i\xe7in se\xe7ti\u011finiz logo tekliflerde g\xf6r\xfcnmesi i\xe7in hesab\u0131n\u0131zda saklan\u0131r.</p>\n<h2>Kullan\u0131m ama\xe7lar\u0131</h2><p>Uygulamay\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak ve i\u015finizi saklamak (s\xf6zle\u015fmenin ifas\u0131), \xf6deme almak ve yasal y\xfck\xfcml\xfcl\xfckleri yerine getirmek, destek vermek, doland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve eri\u015fim payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 \xf6nlemek ve kullan\u0131m\u0131 \xf6l\xe7mek i\xe7in. Sponsorlara yaln\u0131zca toplam say\u0131lar\u0131 bildiririz, kim oldu\u011funuzu asla.</p>\n<h2>M\xfc\u015fterilerinizin verileri</h2><p>Uygulamaya hangi m\xfc\u015fteri verilerini girece\u011finize siz karar verirsiniz ve bunun i\xe7in yasal dayana\u011fa sahip olmaktan siz sorumlusunuz. Bu verilerde IPDRX, uygulaman\u0131n kullan\u0131m\u0131na uygun olarak veri i\u015fleyen s\u0131fat\u0131yla hareket eder.</p>\n<h2>Kimlerle payla\u015f\u0131yoruz</h2><p>Yaln\u0131zca gerekli sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131larla: Supabase (veritaban\u0131 ve giri\u015f, sunucular ABD'de), Expo (uygulama g\xfcncellemesi), Brevo (e-postalar), GitHub (yedekler), Asaas (\xf6demeler) ve bir hata izleme hizmeti. Brezilya d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda sunucular bulundu\u011fundan, s\xf6zle\u015fmenin ifas\u0131 i\xe7in ve g\xfcvenlik \xf6nlemleri alan sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131larla uluslararas\u0131 veri aktar\u0131m\u0131 yap\u0131l\u0131r. Verilerinizi satmay\u0131z.</p>\n<h2>Ne kadar s\xfcreyle</h2><p>Hesab\u0131n\u0131z var oldu\u011fu s\xfcrece. Hesab\u0131 sildi\u011finizde ki\u015fisel verilerinizi ve i\u015finizi sileriz; bunlar yedeklerin planl\u0131 silinmesine kadar yedeklerde kalabilir. \xd6deme kay\u0131tlar\u0131, yasalar\u0131n gerektirdi\u011fi s\xfcre boyunca do\u011frudan kimlik bilgisi olmadan saklan\u0131r.</p>\n<h2>Haklar\u0131n\u0131z (LGPD)</h2><p>Yukar\u0131daki e-posta ile do\u011frulama ve eri\u015fim, d\xfczeltme, ta\u015f\u0131nabilirlik, silme ve payla\u015f\u0131m hakk\u0131nda bilgi isteyebilir, ayr\u0131ca r\u0131zan\u0131z\u0131 geri alabilirsiniz. Brezilya veri koruma kurumu ANPD'ye de \u015fik\xe2yette bulunabilirsiniz.</p>\n<h2>Yapay zek\xe2</h2><p>Uygulama bug\xfcn hakk\u0131n\u0131zda karar vermek i\xe7in yapay zek\xe2 kullanm\u0131yor. Bu de\u011fi\u015firse, \xf6zelli\u011fi kullanmadan \xf6nce sizi a\xe7\u0131k\xe7a bilgilendiririz.</p>\n<h2>G\xfcvenlik ve ya\u015f</h2><p>Her kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n yaln\u0131zca kendi verilerini g\xf6rmesi i\xe7in \u015fifreli ba\u011flant\u0131 ve kurallar kullan\u0131r\u0131z. Uygulama 18 ya\u015f\u0131ndan b\xfcy\xfckler i\xe7indir.</p>\n<h2>Hesab\u0131 silme</h2><p>Uygulamada: D\xfckk\xe2n\u0131m \u203a Hesab\u0131m ve gizlilik \u203a Hesab\u0131m\u0131 sil. Veya web \xfczerinden nas\u0131l isteyece\u011finize bak\u0131n.</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"tr-TR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>Destek</title></head><body>\n<h1>Destek \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>IPDRX ile <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> e-posta adresinden veya +55 (37) 99999-9921 numaral\u0131 telefondan ileti\u015fime ge\xe7in.</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, Brezilya</p>\n<p>Telefonunuzu mu de\u011fi\u015ftirdiniz? Yeni cihaz\u0131n a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 isteyin. \u015eifrenizi mi unuttunuz? Giri\u015f ekran\u0131nda <b>\u015eifremi unuttum</b>'a dokunun.</p>\n<p>Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015fullar\u0131 \xb7 Gizlilik Politikas\u0131 \xb7 Hesab\u0131 sil</p>\n</body></html>\n"},ja:{termos:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja-JP\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>\u5229\u7528\u898f\u7d04</title></head><body>\n<h1>\u5229\u7528\u898f\u7d04 \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">\u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3 1.0 \u2014 2026\u5e7411\u67088\u65e5</p>\n<p>\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3088\u308a\u3001CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA(CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85\u3001Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, \u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb\u3001\u4ee5\u4e0b\u300cIPDRX\u300d)\u3068\u306e\u9593\u3067\u672c\u898f\u7d04\u306b\u540c\u610f\u3057\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9</h2><p>Martelinho Pro\u306f\u3001\u30c7\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u30da\u30a2\u306e\u5c02\u9580\u5bb6\u306e\u898b\u7a4d\u3082\u308a\u3001\u4e88\u5b9a\u7ba1\u7406\u3001\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u30a4\u30f3\u3001\u7d0d\u8eca\u3001\u4f1a\u8a08\u3001\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u3092\u652f\u63f4\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u7b97\u51fa\u3055\u308c\u305f\u91d1\u984d\u306f\u63d0\u6848\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u4fa1\u683c\u306e\u6c7a\u5b9a\u304a\u3088\u3073\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306b\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u306f\u3054\u81ea\u8eab\u306e\u8cac\u4efb\u3068\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8</h2><p>18\u6b73\u4ee5\u4e0a\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u6b63\u78ba\u306a\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u306f\u500b\u4eba\u7528\u3067\u3001\u30b9\u30de\u30db1\u53f0\u3068\u30d1\u30bd\u30b3\u30f31\u53f0\u3067\u5229\u7528\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4e0d\u6b63\u884c\u70ba\u3001\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u306e\u5171\u6709\u3001\u9055\u6cd5\u306a\u5229\u7528\u304c\u3042\u3063\u305f\u5834\u5408\u3001IPDRX\u306f\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u505c\u6b62\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u4f53\u9a13\u3068\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3</h2><p>\u65b0\u898f\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u306b\u306f\u4f53\u9a13\u671f\u9593\u304c\u8a2d\u3051\u3089\u308c\u308b\u5834\u5408\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\u306e\u5951\u7d04\u306f\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2\u3092\u4ecb\u3055\u305aIPDRX\u3068\u76f4\u63a5\u884c\u3044\u3001\u4fa1\u683c\u3001\u671f\u9593\u3001\u66f4\u65b0\u6761\u4ef6\u306f\u652f\u6255\u3044\u524d\u306b\u901a\u77e5\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6709\u52b9\u306a\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\u304c\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u3001\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u524a\u9664\u305b\u305a\u306b\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3092\u4e00\u6642\u505c\u6b62\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u89e3\u7d04\u6a29(\u30af\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u30aa\u30d5)</h2><p>\u9060\u9694\u5951\u7d04\u306e\u5834\u5408\u3001\u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb\u6d88\u8cbb\u8005\u4fdd\u8b77\u6cd5\u7b2c49\u6761\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u304d\u3001\u5951\u7d04\u304b\u3089\u66a6\u65e5\u30677\u65e5\u4ee5\u5185\u3067\u3042\u308c\u3070\u89e3\u7d04\u3057\u3001\u652f\u6255\u984d\u306e\u8fd4\u91d1\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002<a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> \u307e\u3067\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u3067\u3054\u8acb\u6c42\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u89e3\u7d04</h2><p>\u540c\u3058\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u3078\u306e\u9023\u7d61\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u5185\u3067\u306e\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u524a\u9664\u306b\u3088\u308a\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u89e3\u7d04\u3057\u3001\u4ee5\u964d\u306e\u8acb\u6c42\u3092\u505c\u6b62\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2\u3067\u767b\u9332\u3057\u305f\u30b5\u30d6\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306f\u3001\u305d\u306e\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2\u3067\u89e3\u7d04\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u8a31\u53ef\u3055\u308c\u308b\u5229\u7528</h2><p>\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306e\u8907\u88fd\u3001\u8ee2\u58f2\u3001\u4e0d\u6b63\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u306e\u8a66\u307f\u306f\u7981\u6b62\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5165\u529b\u3059\u308b\u5199\u771f\u3084\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306f\u3001\u6cd5\u5f8b\u304a\u3088\u3073\u7b2c\u4e09\u8005\u306e\u6a29\u5229\u3092\u5c0a\u91cd\u3059\u308b\u3082\u306e\u3067\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306f\u3001\u6cd5\u7684\u6839\u62e0\u304c\u3042\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306b\u306e\u307f\u8a18\u9332\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u63d0\u4f9b\u72b6\u6cc1\u3068\u8cac\u4efb</h2><p>\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u3092\u7d99\u7d9a\u3057\u3066\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u52aa\u3081\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4e2d\u65ad\u304c\u767a\u751f\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6cd5\u5f8b\u3067\u8a8d\u3081\u3089\u308c\u308b\u7bc4\u56f2\u3067\u3001IPDRX\u306f\u9038\u5931\u5229\u76ca\u3084\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306e\u63d0\u6848\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u304f\u5224\u65ad\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8cac\u4efb\u3092\u8ca0\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u672c\u898f\u7d04\u306f\u6d88\u8cbb\u8005\u306b\u4fdd\u969c\u3055\u308c\u305f\u6a29\u5229\u3092\u5236\u9650\u3059\u308b\u3082\u306e\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30e9\u30a4\u30bb\u30f3\u30b9</h2><p>\u4e00\u90e8\u306e3D\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u306f\u7b2c\u4e09\u8005\u306e\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u30af\u30ec\u30b8\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u5185\u306b\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u5909\u66f4\u3068\u7ba1\u8f44</h2><p>\u91cd\u8981\u306a\u5909\u66f4\u306f\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u5185\u3067\u304a\u77e5\u3089\u305b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb\u6cd5\u304c\u9069\u7528\u3055\u308c\u3001\u6d88\u8cbb\u8005\u306e\u4f4f\u6240\u5730\u306e\u88c1\u5224\u6240\u3092\u7ba1\u8f44\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30b7\u30fc\u30dd\u30ea\u30b7\u30fc\u3082\u3054\u78ba\u8a8d\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n</body></html>\n",privacidade:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja-JP\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}h2{color:#F5B800;font-size:18px;margin-top:26px}a{color:#2fb8ff}.p{color:#9a978e;font-size:14px}</style><title>\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30b7\u30fc\u30dd\u30ea\u30b7\u30fc</title></head><body>\n<h1>\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30b7\u30fc\u30dd\u30ea\u30b7\u30fc \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p class=\"p\">\u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3 1.0 \u2014 2026\u5e7411\u67088\u65e5</p>\n<p>\u672c\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306fCLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA(CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85\u3001Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, \u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb\u3001\u4ee5\u4e0b\u300cIPDRX\u300d)\u304c\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u500b\u4eba\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u304a\u554f\u3044\u5408\u308f\u305b:<a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a></p>\n<h2>\u53d6\u308a\u6271\u3046\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf</h2><ul>\n<li><b>\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8:</b>\u6c0f\u540d\u3001\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u3001WhatsApp\u3001\u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9(\u6697\u53f7\u5316\u3057\u3066\u4fdd\u5b58\u3057\u3001\u5f53\u793e\u3067\u3082\u8aad\u307f\u53d6\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093)\u3002</li>\n<li><b>\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u3067\u306e\u696d\u52d9:</b>\u5e97\u8217\u3001\u898b\u7a4d\u3082\u308a\u3001\u4e88\u5b9a\u3001\u4f1a\u8a08\u3001\u5165\u529b\u3055\u308c\u305f\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf(\u6c0f\u540d\u3001WhatsApp\u3001\u30ca\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u3001\u8eca)\u3002</li>\n<li><b>\u5229\u7528\u72b6\u6cc1\u3068\u7aef\u672b:</b>\u30b9\u30de\u30db1\u53f0\u30fb\u30d1\u30bd\u30b3\u30f31\u53f0\u306e\u5236\u9650\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u3001\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u65e5\u3001\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u56de\u6570\u3001\u30d0\u30ca\u30fc\u306e\u8868\u793a\u3084\u30af\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u3002</li>\n<li><b>\u652f\u6255\u3044:</b>\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\u3001\u91d1\u984d\u3001\u65e5\u4ed8\u3001\u72b6\u6cc1\u3002\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u60c5\u5831\u306f\u5f53\u793e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u6c7a\u6e08\u4e8b\u696d\u8005\u304c\u4fdd\u6301\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</li></ul>\n<h2>\u5199\u771f</h2><p>\u30ab\u30e1\u30e9\u306f\u64ae\u5f71\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u30bf\u30c3\u30d7\u3057\u305f\u3068\u304d\u306e\u307f\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u30a4\u30f3\u306e\u5199\u771f\u306f\u3001\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u3068\u304d\u306b\u53d6\u5f97\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3088\u3046\u3001\u7aef\u672b\u304a\u3088\u3073<b>\u3054\u81ea\u8eab\u306e\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u307f\u304c\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3067\u304d\u308b\u30af\u30e9\u30a6\u30c9\u306e\u975e\u516c\u958b\u9818\u57df</b>\u306b\u4fdd\u5b58\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u304b\u3089\u306e\u82e6\u60c5\u306b\u5099\u3048\u308b\u671f\u9593\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u8eca\u304c\u7d0d\u8eca\u6e08\u307f\u3068\u306a\u3063\u3066\u304b\u30897\u65e5\u5f8c\u3001\u7d0d\u8eca\u6e08\u307f\u306b\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306f60\u65e5\u4ee5\u5185\u306b\u3001\u7aef\u672b\u3068\u30af\u30e9\u30a6\u30c9\u304b\u3089\u81ea\u52d5\u3067\u524a\u9664\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5e97\u8217\u7528\u306b\u9078\u3093\u3060\u30ed\u30b4\u306f\u3001\u898b\u7a4d\u3082\u308a\u306b\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u306b\u4fdd\u5b58\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u5229\u7528\u76ee\u7684</h2><p>\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306e\u52d5\u4f5c\u3068\u696d\u52d9\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306e\u4fdd\u5b58(\u5951\u7d04\u306e\u5c65\u884c)\u3001\u8acb\u6c42\u304a\u3088\u3073\u6cd5\u7684\u7fa9\u52d9\u306e\u9075\u5b88\u3001\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u63d0\u4f9b\u3001\u4e0d\u6b63\u884c\u70ba\u3084\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u5171\u6709\u306e\u9632\u6b62\u3001\u5229\u7528\u72b6\u6cc1\u306e\u6e2c\u5b9a\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u5229\u7528\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30b9\u30dd\u30f3\u30b5\u30fc\u306b\u306f\u5408\u8a08\u6570\u306e\u307f\u3092\u4f1d\u3048\u3001\u500b\u4eba\u3092\u7279\u5b9a\u3059\u308b\u60c5\u5831\u306f\u4f1d\u3048\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf</h2><p>\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306b\u5165\u529b\u3059\u308b\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306f\u3054\u81ea\u8eab\u3067\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3057\u3001\u305d\u306e\u6cd5\u7684\u6839\u62e0\u3092\u6709\u3059\u308b\u8cac\u4efb\u306f\u3054\u81ea\u8eab\u306b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3001IPDRX\u306f\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306e\u5229\u7528\u306b\u5f93\u3046\u51e6\u7406\u8005\u3068\u3057\u3066\u884c\u52d5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u5171\u6709\u5148</h2><p>\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u4e8b\u696d\u8005\u306e\u307f\u3068\u5171\u6709\u3057\u307e\u3059:Supabase(\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u3068\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u3001\u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u306f\u7c73\u56fd)\u3001Expo(\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306e\u66f4\u65b0)\u3001Brevo(\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb)\u3001GitHub(\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7)\u3001Asaas(\u652f\u6255\u3044)\u3001\u30a8\u30e9\u30fc\u76e3\u8996\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u3002\u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb\u56fd\u5916\u306b\u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u304c\u3042\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u5951\u7d04\u306e\u5c65\u884c\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u30bb\u30ad\u30e5\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u5bfe\u7b56\u3092\u8b1b\u3058\u305f\u4e8b\u696d\u8005\u3068\u306e\u9593\u3067\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306e\u56fd\u969b\u79fb\u8ee2\u304c\u884c\u308f\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u8ca9\u58f2\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u4fdd\u5b58\u671f\u9593</h2><p>\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u304c\u5b58\u5728\u3059\u308b\u9593\u4fdd\u5b58\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3059\u308b\u3068\u500b\u4eba\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3068\u696d\u52d9\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u6d88\u53bb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u4e88\u5b9a\u3055\u308c\u305f\u524a\u9664\u307e\u3067\u306f\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306b\u6b8b\u308b\u5834\u5408\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u652f\u6255\u3044\u8a18\u9332\u306f\u3001\u6cd5\u5f8b\u3067\u5b9a\u3081\u3089\u308c\u305f\u671f\u9593\u3001\u76f4\u63a5\u306e\u8b58\u5225\u60c5\u5831\u306a\u3057\u3067\u4fdd\u7ba1\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306e\u6a29\u5229(LGPD)</h2><p>\u4e0a\u8a18\u306e\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u304b\u3089\u3001\u78ba\u8a8d\u3068\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3001\u8a02\u6b63\u3001\u30dd\u30fc\u30bf\u30d3\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u3001\u524a\u9664\u3001\u5171\u6709\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u8acb\u6c42\u3067\u304d\u3001\u540c\u610f\u3092\u64a4\u56de\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u4fdd\u8b77\u6a5f\u95a2ANPD\u306b\u82e6\u60c5\u3092\u7533\u3057\u7acb\u3066\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u4eba\u5de5\u77e5\u80fd</h2><p>\u73fe\u5728\u3001\u672c\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306f\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u5224\u65ad\u306b\u4eba\u5de5\u77e5\u80fd\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u5909\u66f4\u304c\u3042\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306f\u3001\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e\u3054\u5229\u7528\u524d\u306b\u660e\u78ba\u306b\u304a\u77e5\u3089\u305b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30bb\u30ad\u30e5\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u3068\u5e74\u9f62</h2><p>\u6697\u53f7\u5316\u901a\u4fe1\u3068\u3001\u5404\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u304c\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306e\u307f\u3092\u95b2\u89a7\u3067\u304d\u308b\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u672c\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306f18\u6b73\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306e\u65b9\u3092\u5bfe\u8c61\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u524a\u9664</h2><p>\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u5185:\u5e97\u8217\u60c5\u5831 \u203a \u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3068\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30b7\u30fc \u203a \u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3002\u307e\u305f\u306fWeb\u3067\u306e\u7533\u8acb\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n</body></html>\n",suporte:"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja-JP\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>body{background:#0b0b0c;color:#e8e6df;font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;max-width:720px;padding:20px 16px 48px}h1{color:#F5B800;font-size:24px}a{color:#2fb8ff}</style><title>\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8</title></head><body>\n<h1>\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8 \u2014 Martelinho Pro</h1><p>IPDRX\u3078\u306e\u3054\u9023\u7d61\u306f\u3001\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb <a href=\"mailto:ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com\">ipdrmartelinho@gmail.com</a> \u307e\u305f\u306f\u96fb\u8a71 +55 (37) 99999-9921 \u307e\u3067\u304a\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p><p>IPDRX \xb7 CLAUDINEY RODRIGUES DA SILVA \xb7 CNPJ 09.586.411/0001-85 \xb7 Rua Sete de Setembro, 36, Centro, Cl\xe1udio/MG, CEP 35530-000, \u30d6\u30e9\u30b8\u30eb</p>\n<p>\u30b9\u30de\u30db\u3092\u5909\u66f4\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304b?\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u7aef\u672b\u306e\u627f\u8a8d\u3092\u3054\u4f9d\u983c\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u304a\u5fd8\u308c\u3067\u3059\u304b?\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u753b\u9762\u3067<b>\u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u305f</b>\u3092\u30bf\u30c3\u30d7\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<p>\u5229\u7528\u898f\u7d04 \xb7 \u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30b7\u30fc\u30dd\u30ea\u30b7\u30fc \xb7 \u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u524a\u9664</p>\n</body></html>\n"}}},1015,[]);
